                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For the statements by the United States and the United Kingdom Groups on the
                    retention of British military rights in Egypt and on the maintenance of the
                    British position in the Sudan, made during “The Pentagon Talks of 1947”, see
                        <ref target="#pg584">pages 584</ref>, <ref target="#pg590">590</ref>.</p>
            </div>
